=== Districts ===
{{main|Districts of Akyatan}}

Akyatan is divided into seven geographical districts, each with its own distinct character and administrative center. Six of these districts were once independent towns incorporated during various periods of expansion; the seventh, Isla Verde, was developed from reclaimed land in the late 20th century.

